[00:01.80] (Will L. Thompson)
[00:20.90] (Softly and tenderly)
[00:21.92] Softly and tenderly Jesus is calling
[00:30.64] Calling for you and for me
[00:39.00] See on the portal he's waiting and watching
[00:50.96] Watching for you and for me.
[01:00.94] Come home, come home
[01:10.70] Ye who are weary come home
[01:20.98] Earnestly, tenderly Jesus is calling
[01:31.50] Calling, oh sinner, come home.
[01:42.70] (Why should we tarry when Jesus is pleading)
[01:52.20] Pleading for you and for me
[02:00.18] (Why should we linger and heed not his calling)
[02:12.38] Calling for you and for me.
[02:22.02] Come home, come home
[02:32.42] Ye who are weary come home
[02:43.40] Earnestly, tenderly Jesus is calling
[02:52.18] Calling, oh sinner, come home...
